# Only the accounts server is built as an image (packages/server/Dockerfile).
# Allowlist its inputs so source, env files and keys never enter the build
# context. Runtime config comes from Coolify's environment, filled by
# `hatchkit sync` from the encrypted .env.production.
*
!package.json
!pnpm-lock.yaml
!pnpm-workspace.yaml
!packages/server
packages/server/node_modules
packages/server/dist
packages/server/.env*
**/*.pem
**/*.key
